      query in motivation: https://semsearch.blog/?q=Postgres+vs+MySQL&lang=en

      other queries https://semsearch.blog/?q=Sony+E+Mount+full+frame+travel+lens&lang=en

      ...more examples? what work what does not
    }
    @para{
      against other tools: google?
      https://semsearch.blog/?q=Framework+Laptop+Review+&lang=en
      https://www.google.com/search?q=Framework+Laptop+Review
      https://semsearch.blog/?q=Best+sony+e+mount+travel+lens&lang=en
      https://www.google.com/search?q=Best+sony+e+mount+travel+lens
    }
    @heading["limit"]{Limitations & Future Works}
    @para{
      search quality
      quirks: "framework laptop review" "Framework Laptop review" former doesnt work while latter works well
